gantt
    title Links and callbacks
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    todayMarker off
    section Links
        Task with link    :l1, 2020-02-03, 5d
        Task with call    :l2, after l1, 5d
        Done and linked   :done, l3, after l2, 4d
    click l1 href "https://example.com"
    click l2 call callback()
    click l3 href "https://example.org"
